================ 0b80c87
0b80c87 P2-AR-0041: post-merge reconciliation — schema cache after install, KERNEL.yaml mirror, health payload, ws04r3 premise

- runtime/src/project.rs: Project::invalidate also resets the schema registry, so the overlay a
  migration delivers (WS-9 sync_overlay_template -> WS-6's REPOSITORY_CONTRACT with the new
  class 'operational' / mutation 'os-only', schema 1.1.0) is validated against the schemas of the
  kernel just installed, not the previous kernel's (every update test failed OVERLAY_INVALID).
- framework/KERNEL.yaml: schema_versions mirror every round-3 bump (IP-R3-WS08-7): adoption-baseline
  1.2.0, migration 1.2.0 (WS-9), cit 1.1.0, record 1.1.0 (WS-4), index-manifest 1.2.0,
  repository-contract 1.1.0 (WS-6), plugin-descriptor 1.4.0 (WS-7), task 1.2.0, test-obligation
  1.1.0 (WS-5); 'health' joins payload_dirs now that WS-2 removed the planted literal and the
  kernel's own scanner finds framework/health clean (IP-R3-WS08-5, enforced by ws08_r3).
- tests/certification/ws04r3.rs: direct_propagation test's work writes src/**, so its class is
  'refactor' (WS-5's BC-P2-13 in-task hook refuses a discovery task changing product source), as
  WS-5 updated ws04r2; assertions unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>


