— already in WS-3's round-3 gates.rs (t2::seal_if_verified in answer/revoke; equivalent to WS-4's
6-line patch, which no longer applies textually); (2) 'cit' joins t2::SEALED_RECORD_TYPES
(IP-R3-WS03-2); (3) ws04r3::a_cit_declined_during_another_tasks_claim_does_not_block_its_close
